      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 171 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(How Korea was Founded)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "This is the story about how the nation of Korea was founded."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Our country’s history started about 5,000 years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Once upon a time the King of Heaven, Hwan-in, sent his son,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Hwan-ung, to Earth. While living on Earth,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "he married Ung-nyo who had changed from a bear into a woman."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She gave birth to a son and named him Dan-goon."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He became the founder of Korea."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "The country's ancient name was Gojoson."
    },
    {
